# Tools — the implement made for the act
#
# The counterpart to tool_excluded_verb.cli, against the same excluded verb and in the same room.
# Reading lenses declare EXAMINE in Item.MadeForVerbIds, and that single declaration changes three
# things at once. Its other edge — that the same declaration REFUSES them for every other act — is
# asserted separately, in tool_not_its_purpose.cli:
#
#   * they are OFFERED at all. Lenses are a garment by category, and combinable items are otherwise
#     tools and weapons only — GetCombinableItems admits anything declaring an exception precisely
#     so the mechanism is not unreachable for everything that is not already a tool;
#   * the combination is ACCEPTED against a verb that admits no implement. This is the only road
#     into an excluded act, and the reason exclusion can be a category rather than a case-by-case
#     judgement: the item declares what it is for, from its own side;
#   * it is accepted with NO critic call and NO noetic cost, so the budget is unchanged across it.
#
# The proof of acceptance is the reformulated action: a combination that is accepted rewrites the
# act to incorporate the implement and offers THAT as a second button. Refusal leaves one button,
# which is what the excluded script asserts.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-item reading_lenses --location-type test --location-id 0 --npc-static --start-area "Test Yard" --period noon --observe-only "Test Rack"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal examine
advance 12 180

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180

inspect noetic

click action 0
regions
choose 1
regions
choose 0
advance 12 180

# Accepted: the reformulated act is on screen as a second button, and the budget did not move.
regions
inspect noetic

# Unchanged: an accepted combination is free. The deliberation took the pool from 2 to 1 and
# nothing since has touched it.
expect-state noetic points=1/2
expect-state noetic tool_proficiency=Low

click action 1
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180

expect SUCCESS
expect-verb examine

quit
